	"Description": "Adds new textures for the Long Palm of a new mermaid statue in 4 colors, with optional algae, patina, and seasonal overlays.\n<br />\n<br />It's recommended you use [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/93]CJB Item Spawner[/url] to add the Long Palm into your game. It's a mid-late game item, and the only one which was tall enough for the sprite.\n<br />\n<br />Thank you [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/users/177391248]otohimexoxo[/url]\uFEFF for encouraging me, and giving the idea to use the statue on the farm! The statue is for an upcoming bathhouse mod, but it's a long way from finished.\n<br />\n<br />[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/19810]Available for Content Patcher[/url]!",
